  "description": "Certificate of lawfulness for the proposed use of one room on the ground floor of the premises as a booking office for a private vehicle hire business.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 13/08/2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing submitted on 11/06/2026 and numbered Unnumbered Site Location Plan and on 11/06/2026 and numbered Unnumbered Proposed Floor Plans was lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because:\r\n\r\nThe private vehicle hire business within the property would not have public access, and there would be only one operator at the premises. No external alterations are proposed.  There would be no picking up or dropping off of customers at the site, nor would there be the comings and goings of drivers to the premises. The nature and scale of the business use would not constitute a material change of use of part or the whole of the house, and therefore, planning permission is not required.\r\n"
  ],
